WEBVTT

00:08.770 --> 00:15.380
<b>Dareka ga sutete-shimatta
kinou o hiroi-age</b>

00:15.380 --> 00:18.710
<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.710 --> 00:22.020
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:22.020 --> 00:27.460
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo manzoku
suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.660 --> 00:34.600
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro no
sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.600 --> 00:36.670
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.670 --> 00:41.900
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka ni kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.900 --> 00:44.940
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:44.940 --> 00:48.210
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.210 --> 00:51.810
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.810 --> 00:55.480
<b>Ima sugu ni</b>

01:06.030 --> 01:08.060
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.060 --> 01:13.300
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no naka jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.300 --> 01:16.400
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.400 --> 01:19.640
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.640 --> 01:23.210
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.210 --> 01:25.870
<b>Ima sugu ni</b>

01:30.350 --> 01:31.820
<b>Now, let's begin.</b>

01:43.730 --> 01:46.330
<b>Release your powers, Son Goku.</b>

01:46.970 --> 01:51.010
<b>Your thirst and your rage</b>

01:51.010 --> 01:53.240
<b>will become the origin of the new
Heaven and Earth!</b>

01:54.710 --> 01:57.800
<b>You'll be the master of its creation!</b>

02:18.470 --> 02:21.530
<b>That's it, Son Goku. That's your...</b>

02:28.380 --> 02:29.840
<b>Not yet.</b>

02:31.650 --> 02:36.850
<b>I can't allow this life to end yet!</b>

02:38.290 --> 02:39.920
<b>Move aside.</b>

02:39.920 --> 02:41.260
<b>What're you trying to pull?</b>

02:41.260 --> 02:43.490
<b>This guy's my prey.</b>

02:43.490 --> 02:45.260
<b>That's optimistic, Kougaiji.</b>

02:45.260 --> 02:46.990
<b>We'll have to see who actually gets hunted.</b>

02:47.830 --> 02:49.430
<b>We'll know soon enough.</b>

02:49.430 --> 02:51.130
<b>Is that so?</b>

02:51.130 --> 02:52.260
<b>Prepare yourself!</b>

02:59.210 --> 03:00.740
<b>Stop this.</b>

03:00.740 --> 03:05.880
<b>I don't wish to fight a weak
child such as yourself.</b>

03:05.880 --> 03:07.350
<b>Child?</b>

03:09.650 --> 03:13.180
<b>Don't underestimate me! I can be
tough when I want to be!</b>

03:15.490 --> 03:16.960
<b>True.</b>

03:19.430 --> 03:22.450
<b>Then, I shall fight you in earnest.</b>

03:37.010 --> 03:38.480
<b>Kai!</b>

03:40.650 --> 03:43.140
<b>Damn, not bad!</b>

03:44.590 --> 03:46.710
<b>We're not going to get anywhere at this rate.</b>

03:50.590 --> 03:53.220
<b>You want to hurry up and
finish this too, right?</b>

03:55.200 --> 03:56.660
<b>Damn straight.</b>

03:57.500 --> 03:59.400
<b>Go ahead and shoot.</b>

03:59.400 --> 04:01.940
<b>Did you think I'd protect you?</b>

04:01.940 --> 04:03.400
<b>Like hell!</b>

04:13.850 --> 04:14.720
<b>Sorry for the wait!</b>

04:14.720 --> 04:15.480
<b>Kougaiji!
Sorry for the wait!</b>

04:15.480 --> 04:16.220
<b>Kougaiji!
I'm glad to see you're both safe.</b>

04:16.220 --> 04:17.550
<b>I'm glad to see you're both safe.</b>

04:17.550 --> 04:19.880
<b>Damn, what a boorish bunch.</b>

04:20.660 --> 04:23.260
<b>Sanzo! Where's Goku?!</b>

04:23.260 --> 04:24.730
<b>What happened to Goku?!</b>

04:27.230 --> 04:29.760
<b>Don't tell me you... You loser!</b>

04:29.760 --> 04:31.270
<b>Shut up!</b>

04:31.270 --> 04:35.600
<b>Will you be able to continue to
be that little runt's sun?</b>

04:37.740 --> 04:39.210
<b>What is it now?</b>

04:42.640 --> 04:45.150
<b>Where the hell did they take him?!</b>

04:45.150 --> 04:46.980
<b>You think you've got time, you bastard?!</b>

04:52.550 --> 04:54.520
<b>Gojyo...</b>

04:54.520 --> 04:56.420
<b>I'll give you a chance to show off.</b>

04:56.420 --> 04:57.590
<b>What'd you say?</b>

04:57.590 --> 04:59.050
<b>I'm leaving this to you.</b>

05:00.600 --> 05:03.190
<b>Sanzo! Sanzo!</b>

05:23.920 --> 05:26.690
<b>Can you see it, Rinrei?</b>

05:26.690 --> 05:29.890
<b>That's the world we dream of.</b>

05:29.890 --> 05:32.450
<b>Neither restrictions nor taboos exist there.</b>

05:39.700 --> 05:44.700
<b>There's freedom, completely
unfettered freedom.</b>

05:55.820 --> 05:59.410
<b>Be strong. Be strong, Genjo Sanzo.</b>

06:08.030 --> 06:09.500
<b>What do you want?</b>

06:10.870 --> 06:15.700
<b>He took the Seiten Scripture from
right in front of my eyes.</b>

06:16.840 --> 06:19.570
<b>I'll never be satisfied until I get it back.</b>

06:19.570 --> 06:21.440
<b>It belongs to my master.</b>

06:22.040 --> 06:23.510
<b>That's not it!</b>

06:26.550 --> 06:29.710
<b>What I'm talking about is my pride.</b>

06:30.590 --> 06:32.090
<b>Son Goku,</b>

06:32.090 --> 06:35.580
<b>ultimately, you and I were both
heretical beings in this land.</b>

06:36.490 --> 06:39.120
<b>But in this new world...</b>

06:42.900 --> 06:45.390
<b>Wow! It's so shiny.</b>

06:54.640 --> 06:56.110
<b>It's like the sun.</b>

07:37.620 --> 07:39.090
<b>I see.</b>

07:39.650 --> 07:41.620
<b>So this is you?!</b>

07:48.460 --> 07:49.930
<b>What the hell's that?!</b>

07:59.740 --> 08:00.980
<b>Here he comes.</b>

08:00.980 --> 08:02.440
<b>What?!</b>

08:11.790 --> 08:13.220
<b>Kai!</b>

08:14.490 --> 08:16.290
<b>Shoot!</b>

08:16.290 --> 08:17.760
<b>It won't work on him!</b>

08:24.430 --> 08:27.030
<b>Moron! Don't get cocky!</b>

08:43.690 --> 08:45.150
<b>Son Goku!</b>

08:50.530 --> 08:51.990
<b>Again...</b>

08:52.590 --> 08:55.320
<b>He's smiling again!</b>

08:55.930 --> 08:57.400
<b>Move aside.</b>

08:58.100 --> 08:59.660
<b>Sanzo, what are you...</b>

09:00.270 --> 09:03.200
<b>Brats need to be punished.</b>

09:09.210 --> 09:12.540
<b>I told you, didn't I? That I'd
get my pride back?</b>

09:18.650 --> 09:22.020
<b>It's been a long time since I
fought with you last.</b>

09:22.020 --> 09:24.290
<b>Of course, you don't remember, do you?</b>

09:26.160 --> 09:28.290
<b>Let's do it, Son Goku!</b>

09:30.600 --> 09:32.230
<b>That's it. That's how it should be.</b>

09:33.330 --> 09:37.140
<b>You're the one and only unique
being in this world.</b>

09:37.140 --> 09:39.770
<b>Remain true to your way of life!</b>

10:02.730 --> 10:04.670
<b>Scurrying around like damn rats!</b>

10:04.670 --> 10:06.600
<b>That kind of footwork won't do you any good!</b>

10:06.600 --> 10:08.800
<b>Maybe you've smoked too many cigarettes!</b>

10:08.800 --> 10:11.410
<b>You're in no position to say that!</b>

10:11.410 --> 10:13.440
<b>Excellent teamwork.</b>

10:13.440 --> 10:15.380
<b>I shall praise you on your efforts thus far.</b>

10:15.980 --> 10:17.440
<b>Shien...</b>

10:21.350 --> 10:25.080
<b>Shien, let's stop this already.
Further fighting is useless.</b>

10:26.450 --> 10:27.520
<b>Useless?</b>

10:27.520 --> 10:33.390
<b>Yes, all we want is to take back Goku
and the stolen Scripture.</b>

10:33.390 --> 10:37.770
<b>It'd be pointless to continue fighting
and hurting one another.</b>

10:37.770 --> 10:39.730
<b>He's right, he's right! Give it up!</b>

10:42.540 --> 10:44.340
<b>I can't do that.</b>

10:44.340 --> 10:46.040
<b>Why not?!</b>

10:46.040 --> 10:48.270
<b>Battling is our all.</b>

10:50.310 --> 10:53.610
<b>Battling is proof we're alive,</b>

10:53.610 --> 10:55.610
<b>a means of living.</b>

10:58.320 --> 11:02.920
<b>We've devoted our service to
War Prince Homura,</b>

11:02.920 --> 11:06.550
<b>and that's the fate that's been given to us.</b>

11:07.360 --> 11:08.830
<b>That's ridiculous.</b>

11:10.300 --> 11:13.630
<b>There's nothing wrong with that.
That's what they want, right?</b>

11:13.630 --> 11:16.690
<b>If you want to fight, I'll be your
opponent to the bitter end!</b>

11:19.610 --> 11:21.600
<b>How delightful.</b>

11:25.180 --> 11:26.670
<b>Shien!</b>

11:36.860 --> 11:37.760
<b>Shien!</b>

11:37.760 --> 11:41.900
<b>Homura, please go on ahead.</b>

11:41.900 --> 11:44.370
<b>Don't be concerned.</b>

11:44.370 --> 11:46.300
<b>When I've finished here,</b>

11:46.300 --> 11:49.130
<b>I'll come right away, together with Zenon.</b>

11:50.710 --> 11:53.000
<b>I understand. I'll be waiting.</b>

11:55.340 --> 11:58.400
<b>How many centuries has it been
since I've fought in earnest?</b>

11:59.450 --> 12:01.420
<b>You're fortunate.</b>

12:02.680 --> 12:04.410
<b>I shall show you...</b>

12:08.160 --> 12:09.620
<b>...the power of a god.</b>

12:13.290 --> 12:15.490
<b>God, my butt! Don't make me laugh!</b>

12:39.490 --> 12:41.580
<b>What an incredible difference.</b>

12:45.930 --> 12:47.390
<b>Bastard!</b>

12:54.640 --> 12:56.100
<b>Shoot!</b>

13:10.750 --> 13:13.150
<b>Dokugakuji! Gojyo!</b>

13:13.150 --> 13:18.060
<b>If I knew this was coming, I'd have
conserved my energy more.</b>

13:18.060 --> 13:20.260
<b>Are you having regrets?</b>

13:20.260 --> 13:23.630
<b>Oh, please, I don't have the leisure for that.</b>

13:23.630 --> 13:28.070
<b>And besides, regrets are just
a way for fools to kill time.</b>

13:28.070 --> 13:29.470
<b>Fools?</b>

13:29.470 --> 13:33.410
<b>Yes, just as I was once.</b>

13:33.410 --> 13:35.680
<b>Forever regretting a past that
could never be taken back</b>

13:35.680 --> 13:38.010
<b>and continually blaming myself.</b>

13:38.010 --> 13:41.080
<b>Fools like that weak wretch I used to be.</b>

13:41.080 --> 13:43.990
<b>You're by no means weak.</b>

13:43.990 --> 13:46.790
<b>Well, I'm not strong either.</b>

13:46.790 --> 13:49.860
<b>But the reason I can face adversity
with everything I have</b>

13:49.860 --> 13:52.360
<b>is because as unworthy as I am,
there are those I want to protect.</b>

13:52.360 --> 13:56.300
<b>Because I have friends to
help and who help me.</b>

13:56.300 --> 13:57.760
<b>I see.</b>

13:58.900 --> 14:00.640
<b>It's too bad.</b>

14:00.640 --> 14:04.590
<b>I would have liked to speak with you more.</b>

14:18.750 --> 14:22.290
<b>Your friends will meet their end now.</b>

14:22.290 --> 14:24.590
<b>Don't go killing them off.</b>

14:24.590 --> 14:28.120
<b>And they aren't my friends.
They're my servants!</b>

14:39.210 --> 14:40.670
<b>Gojyo!</b>

14:41.510 --> 14:44.510
<b>Do it now. Hurry!</b>

14:44.510 --> 14:46.140
<b>Idiot! What're you saying?!</b>

14:47.280 --> 14:48.750
<b>I can't do that!</b>

14:49.580 --> 14:52.250
<b>But my strength will...</b>

14:56.920 --> 14:58.390
<b>Hakuryu!</b>

15:07.170 --> 15:08.900
<b>Shien, that's enough!</b>

15:08.900 --> 15:11.300
<b>You'll get hurt too at this rate!</b>

15:12.440 --> 15:14.340
<b>No!</b>

15:14.340 --> 15:17.610
<b>I might actually be able to
shatter his qi-gong wave!</b>

15:18.510 --> 15:20.070
<b>Hakuryu, I'm counting on you!</b>

15:29.960 --> 15:32.290
<b>Such effort is useless.</b>

15:32.290 --> 15:38.030
<b>Is it really? Then why do you look so bitter?</b>

15:38.030 --> 15:41.070
<b>Bitter? I?</b>

15:41.070 --> 15:44.540
<b>Yes, you. Your strength seems to me</b>

15:44.540 --> 15:48.080
<b>as though you sought it at the
cost of everything else.</b>

15:48.080 --> 15:50.910
<b>All things come with a sacrifice!</b>

15:50.910 --> 15:53.510
<b>Created by forcing yourself to hide
everything deep in your heart,</b>

15:53.510 --> 15:56.480
<b>even the things that brought you joy and
your painful memories.</b>

15:56.480 --> 15:58.540
<b>It seems fabricated!</b>

15:59.150 --> 16:00.550
<b>Quiet!</b>

16:00.550 --> 16:03.390
<b>But what's your strength for?</b>

16:03.390 --> 16:06.030
<b>Is it only to serve Homura?!</b>

16:06.030 --> 16:11.100
<b>I think... To me, it seems you're
fooling yourself by doing so!</b>

16:11.100 --> 16:12.960
<b>It looks like you're running from something!</b>

16:16.340 --> 16:17.540
<b>Shut up.</b>

16:17.540 --> 16:20.410
<b>What're you running from?</b>

16:20.410 --> 16:23.100
<b>Is your strength only superficial?!</b>

16:24.280 --> 16:25.210
<b>Shut up!</b>

16:25.210 --> 16:29.150
<b>What in the world can you gain by
running away like that?!</b>

16:30.380 --> 16:32.650
<b>Shut up! Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!</b>

16:32.650 --> 16:35.320
<b>You... You're a coward!</b>

16:41.900 --> 16:43.360
<b>Shien!</b>

16:54.880 --> 17:00.880
<b>Who are you calling a coward?</b>

17:00.880 --> 17:05.790
<b>I'm sorry. I had no right to say that.</b>

17:05.790 --> 17:08.220
<b>But in order to win against you...</b>

17:11.230 --> 17:15.090
<b>I see, so I was utterly taken in.</b>

17:16.800 --> 17:19.770
<b>No, it's exactly as you said.</b>

17:19.770 --> 17:22.790
<b>I've been running. Running
away for all this time.</b>

17:24.470 --> 17:28.530
<b>So, I was more cowardly and
weaker than anyone.</b>

17:30.680 --> 17:31.810
<b>Shien!</b>

17:31.810 --> 17:35.680
<b>I'm sorry. I must break my promise.</b>

17:35.680 --> 17:38.620
<b>No! Don't do this, Shien!</b>

17:38.620 --> 17:41.050
<b>I promised to come right away, but...</b>

17:42.520 --> 17:44.750
<b>Come, Shien! To the new world!</b>

17:46.330 --> 17:48.820
<b>I can't come.</b>

17:50.130 --> 17:56.590
<b>But Homura, the dream you allowed
me to have, it was a good dream.</b>

17:58.910 --> 18:00.370
<b>Hakkai...</b>

18:02.040 --> 18:05.380
<b>Having the privilege of fighting
you at the end...</b>

18:10.350 --> 18:13.720
<b>I'm truly glad for it.</b>

18:40.110 --> 18:41.580
<b>Hakkai!</b>

18:42.350 --> 18:44.480
<b>You idiot! You just had to push it!</b>

18:46.820 --> 18:49.150
<b>I've had enough...</b>

18:51.660 --> 18:57.120
<b>...of only being able to watch as
someone else falls apart.</b>

18:59.400 --> 19:00.370
<b>Zenon!</b>

19:00.370 --> 19:00.900
<b>Don't worry.
Zenon!</b>

19:00.900 --> 19:01.830
<b>Don't worry.</b>

19:25.560 --> 19:27.030
<b>Say your prayers!</b>

19:40.470 --> 19:41.940
<b>Hey, wait.</b>

19:42.780 --> 19:44.240
<b>Where do you think you're going?</b>

19:46.750 --> 19:49.910
<b>Aren't you going to watch the
farce you set the stage for?</b>

19:52.020 --> 19:54.150
<b>I'll leave the cleaning up to you.</b>

19:54.150 --> 19:55.620
<b>That's real funny, you bastard.</b>

19:56.220 --> 19:58.120
<b>You better be prepared when I come for you.</b>

20:03.400 --> 20:04.860
<b>Hold it.</b>

20:07.430 --> 20:08.870
<b>It's over, monkey.</b>

20:09.870 --> 20:13.810
<b>If you still haven't had enough fun,
I'll be your opponent now.</b>

20:20.380 --> 20:22.820
<b>I'm sorry, Shien, Zenon.</b>

20:24.590 --> 20:26.050
<b>But even so, I...</b>

20:44.000 --> 20:52.840
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:54.180 --> 21:04.610
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou
no naka ni ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:05.960 --> 21:16.100
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:17.400 --> 21:30.420
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta
kotoba ga fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:30.420 --> 21:41.860
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:41.860 --> 21:53.140
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi
ga tashika ni natteku</b>

21:53.140 --> 22:05.310
<b>Ima nara kitto aruite yukeru doko made mo</b>
